      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-deps7:002",
        "answer": "Accept string, without checking its type or definition. If level.var_13a6af33 is defined, invoke that stored pointer synchronously with string and no explicit receiver. After it returns, loop localclientnum from 0 while below current level.localplayers.size and call native playradiantexploder(localclientnum,string). The loop passes client indexes rather than reading player entries. An undefined pointer skips only the callback. Missing/invalid localplayers, noncallable pointers, callback errors or callback changes to the later loop inputs have no local recovery. No explicit return payload.",
